	30_36: {
		cardInfo: {
			image: hobbit/HDG3036.jpg
			collInfo: 30_36
			rarity: _
		}
		title: Narzug
		subtitle: Orkish Assassin
		unique: true
		side: Shadow
		culture: gundabad
		twilight: 2
		type: minion
		race: orc
		strength: 6
		vitality: 2
		site: 3
		keywords: archer
		effects: [
			{
				// A kill is no discard (CR 4.2 "killed"), so "killed or discarded" is two triggers.
				// player: owner, or the offer goes to the Free Peoples player.
				type: killedTrigger
				optional: true
				player: owner
				requires: {
					type: not
					requires: {
						type: phase
						phase: regroup
					}
				}
				cost: {
					type: removeTwilight
					amount: 3
				}
				effect: {
					type: wound
					select: choose(ally)
					times: 2
				}
			}
			{
				type: SelfRemovedFromPlayTrigger
				optional: true
				method: discarded
				requires: [
					{
						type: not
						requires: {
							type: phase
							phase: regroup
						}
					}
				]
				cost: {
					type: removeTwilight
					amount: 3
				}
				effect: {
					type: wound
					select: choose(ally)
					times: 2
				}
			}
		]
		gametext: <b>Archer</b>.<br>When Narzug is killed or discarded from play (except during the regroup phase), you may remove (3) to wound an ally twice.
		lore: "'The Dwarf runt will never be King!'"
		promotext: ""
		alts: {
			promos: {
			}
			errata: {
			}
		}
	}

	30_37: {
		cardInfo: {
			image: hobbit/HDG3037.jpg
			collInfo: 30_37
			rarity: _
		}
		title: Not at Home
		unique: true
		side: Shadow
		culture: gundabad
		twilight: 2
		type: condition
		keywords: support area
		effects: [
			{
				type: modifier
				modifier: {
					type: comesIntoPlayExhausted
					filter: culture(dwarven),companion
					requires: {
						type: HasCardInDeadPile
						filter: culture(dwarven),companion
					}
				}
			}
			{
				type: activated
				phase: regroup
				effect: [
					{
						type: putCardsFromDiscardOnTopOfDeck
						select: choose(side(shadow),not(name(Smaug)))
					}
					{
						type: discard
						select: self
					}
				]
			}
		]
		gametext: If there is a [dwarven] companion in the dead pile, each [dwarven] companion comes into play exhausted.<br><b>Regroup:</b> Place a Shadow card (except Smaug) from your discard pile on top of your draw deck. Discard this condition.
		lore: "'I'm sure the rain has got into the dry clothes.'"
		promotext: ""
		alts: {
			promos: {
			}
			errata: {
			}
		}
	}

	30_38: {
		cardInfo: {
			image: hobbit/HDG3038.jpg
			collInfo: 30_38
			rarity: _
		}
		title: Orkish Marauder
		unique: false
		side: Shadow
		culture: gundabad
		twilight: 3
		type: minion
		race: orc
		strength: 8
		vitality: 2
		site: 3
		effects: [
			{
				type: Trigger
				optional: true
				trigger: {
					type: played
					filter: self
				}
				requires: {
					type: canSpot
					filter: culture(dwarven),follower
					count: 4
				}
				effect: {
					type: exhaust
					select: choose(culture(dwarven),companion)
				}
			}
			{
				type: activated
				phase: maneuver
				requires: {
					type: canSpot
					filter: companion
					count: 7
				}
				cost: {
					type: removeTwilight
					amount: 2
				}
				effect: {
					type: wound
					select: choose(companion,not(name(Bilbo)))
				}
			}
		]
		gametext: When you play this minion, you may spot 4 [dwarven] followers to exhaust a [dwarven] companion.<br><b>Maneuver:</b> Spot 7 companions and remove (2) to wound a companion (except Bilbo).
		lore: "'The scent is fresh! They took the mountain pass.'"
		promotext: ""
		alts: {
			promos: {
			}
			errata: {
			}
		}
	}

	30_39: {
		cardInfo: {
			image: hobbit/HDG3039.jpg
			collInfo: 30_39
			rarity: _
		}
		title: Orkish Aggressor
		unique: false
		side: Shadow
		culture: gundabad
		twilight: 2
		type: minion
		race: orc
		strength: 6
		vitality: 2
		site: 3
		effects: {
			type: activated
			phase: assignment
			requires: {
				type: canSpot
				filter: name(Bilbo),assignableToSkirmishAgainst(self)
			}
			effect: [
				{
					type: assignFpCharacterToSkirmish
					fpCharacter: choose(name(Bilbo))
					minion: self
				}
				{
					type: optional
					player: fp
					text: Would you like to add a burden to discard {self}?
					cost: {
						type: addBurdens
						amount: 1
					}
					effect: {
						type: discard
						select: self
					}
				}
			]
		}
		gametext: <b>Assignment:</b> Assign this minion to skirmish Bilbo. The Free Peoples player may add a doubt to discard this minion.
		lore: "'Suddenly a rogue goblin attacks him and as they fight they fall off the bridge...'"
		promotext: ""
		alts: {
			promos: {
			}
			errata: {
			}
		}
	}

	30_40: {
		cardInfo: {
			image: hobbit/HDG3040.jpg
			collInfo: 30_40
			rarity: _
		}
		title: Watchful Orc
		unique: false
		side: Shadow
		culture: gundabad
		twilight: 4
		type: minion
		race: orc
		strength: 8
		vitality: 3
		site: 3
		effects: [
			{
				type: Trigger
				optional: true
				trigger: {
					type: played
					filter: self
				}
				effect: {
					type: playNextSite
				}
			}
			{
				type: activated
				phase: shadow
				cost: {
					type: exert
					select: self
					times: 2
				}
				effect: [
					{
						type: chooseAKeyword
						keywords: [
							Battleground
							Mountain
							Forest
							Underground
						]
						memorize: keywordSelected
					}
					{
						type: addKeyword
						select: all(site,zone(adventure path))
						keyword: fromMemory(keywordSelected)
						until: endOfTurn
					}
				]
			}
		]
		gametext: When you play this minion, you may play the fellowship's next site (replacing opponent's site if necessary).<br><b>Shadow:</b> Exert this minion twice to make each site on the adventure path gain battleground, mountain, forest or underground until the end of the turn.
		lore: ""
		promotext: ""
		alts: {
			promos: {
			}
			errata: {
			}
		}
	}

